    "Paragon Dictionary Database File",
    "3.5",
    "Compressed and encrypted archive used for installing MSDNAA (Microsoft Developer Network Academic Alliance) software; often distributed through ELMS (the E-academy License Management System), a system for distributing software packages to academic institutions. NOTE: Secure Download Cabinet files should open automatically with UnpackSDC (unpacksdc.exe) when downloaded. This will extract and install the contents and will delete the SDC file when completed. Therefore, if the SDC file is still on your hard disk after the product has downloaded, you may need to delete the SDC file and try the process again. Windows Microsoft UnpackSDC. Archive of files downloaded with Stardock Central, an enhanced download manager for Stardock software programs; contains installers that have been previously downloaded. Stardock SDC files are created as backup files and are saved in the Program Files/Stardock/Stardock Central/BACKUP directory by default. They can be used to reinstall program updates or to move previous installations to another system. Windows Stardock Central —  (Discontinued). Spreadsheet created with the Calc spreadsheet program included with Apache OpenOffice and StarOffice; includes flexible cell formatting options, such as freely rotating contents, backgrounds, borders, and templates. SDC files can be exported in the Microsoft Excel (.XLS) or Portable Document (.PDF) formats from within Calc. NOTE: Apache OpenOffice was formerly known as OpenOffice.org. Windows OpenOffice Calc. LibreOffice. Mac OpenOffice Calc. Planamesa NeoOffice. LibreOffice. Linux OpenOffice Calc. LibreOfficeFree. An SDC file is a database file used by dictionary applications developed by Paragon Software, most popularly Oxford Advanced Learners Dictionary. It contains dictionary-related content, such as words, definitions, and word pronunciation audio. SDC files are typically large, more than 400MB in size. SDC files are stored on the SD card of an Android device. For example, the SDC file for the Oxford Advanced Learners Dictionary can be found in the following location: /​sdcard/​Android/​data/​com.slovoed.oald/​files/​. Android Oxford Advanced Learners Dictionary.",
    "Windows Microsoft UnpackSDC. Windows Stardock Central —  (Discontinued). Windows OpenOffice Calc. LibreOffice. Mac OpenOffice Calc. Planamesa NeoOffice. LibreOffice. Linux OpenOffice Calc. LibreOffice. Android Oxford Advanced Learners Dictionary.",
