    "3.5",
    "Database schema the defines the structure of a database used by the Radiant One Virtual Directory Server (VDS); may be captured from an existing database using the Database Schema Extractor and can be modified using the Schema Manager within RadiantOne. ORX files are saved in an XML format and contain object classes and attributes for database files used by RadiantOne VDS software. NOTE: .ORx may also be short for.ORG or.OR2 -.OR6, which are file extensions used by Lotus Organizer. Windows Radiant Logic RadiantOne Virtual Directory Server. Linux Radiant Logic RadiantOne Virtual Directory Server.",
