    "Lotus Notes 4 Database",
    "1.5",
    "Database file created by Lotus Notes 4.x; contains a list of contacts, text notes, e-mail messages, calendars, and other information; stores structured data for personal and business organizational management. Domino, the Notes server program, was released in 1996 along with Notes 4.5. Many following updates were only released for Windows, but Lotus Notes 7.0.2 was released for Mac OS X in 2006. Windows IBM Lotus Notes 2 or later Lotus Domino Mac IBM Lotus Notes 2 or later Lotus Domino.",
